# bm_or contract
#
# Enable this file after the BitmapOr binding exists.
#
# Expected semantics:
# - union of two compatible CRoaring-compatible bitmap blobs
# - NULL-preserving for the SQL binding
# - result uses the same FPBM envelope
#
# Cases to enable later:
# - empty OR empty => empty
# - singleton OR singleton => two-element union when distinct
# - overlapping sets do not duplicate row ids

